# Frintezza's cube (GrandBossTeleporter): the exit link of its page (onFirstTalk) sends the character to the
# point outside the Last Imperial Tomb, up to 500 away from it on each axis (onAdvEvent frintezza_exit).
# The reference probe replays the trip.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/grand_boss_teleporter_frintezza_exit.golden
character Pilgrim 60
script script.teleport.GrandBossTeleporter
page script/teleport/GrandBossTeleporter/
npc frintezza 29061 Folk 10 0 0

action frintezza
action frintezza
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=frintezza item=0 page=script/teleport/GrandBossTeleporter/29061-01.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest GrandBossTeleporter frintezza_exit
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S TeleportToLocation obj=player loc=150037,-57720,-2976+-500 fast=0
  S DeleteObject obj=frintezza
